# Code review (build-and-test.md §1, "what the repository owner approves"): the
# branch ruleset requires a code-owner approval of the exact commits that merge.
#
# Get-Sybers is a user account, not an organisation, so the standard's
# @get-sybers/maintainers and @get-sybers/owners teams cannot exist yet; the
# owner reviews everything. Swap the handle for the team slugs when they do.
*                                   @Get-Sybers

# the pipeline and its pins
/.github/                           @Get-Sybers
/Makefile                           @Get-Sybers
/scripts/                           @Get-Sybers
/.golangci.yml                      @Get-Sybers
/go.mod                             @Get-Sybers
/go.sum                             @Get-Sybers
